==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|ampel}}, {{m|gmh|ampolle}}, {{m|gmh|ampulle}}, from {{inh|de|goh|ampla}}, {{m|goh|ampulla|t=vessel}}, from {{der|de|la|ampulla|t=two-handled vessel}}. The sense development was ''vessel'' → ''hanging lamp (in or shaped like a vessel)'' → ''traffic light''.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/ˈʔampl̩/|/ˈʔampəl/}}
* {{audio|de|De-Ampel.ogg|Audio (Germany)}}
* {{audio|de|De-at-Ampel.ogg|Audio (Austria)}}

